 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I need a sick note. I had the flu."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. When did it start? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Last Monday. I'm better now, mostly. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What's left?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A cough."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tired."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Headache?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mild. Comes and goes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fever now?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Gone since Thursday."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Breathless?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What have you been taking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oseltamivir, 75 mg, twice a day, I finish it tomorrow. Paracetamol, 1 gram, when needed. And ibuprofen, 400 mg, with food."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any chest problems in the past?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Asthma, as a kid."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything surgical?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Appendix, in 2010."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Family history of anything relevant?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother has diabetes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me listen. Deep breaths.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your chest is clear on both sides."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the throat is slightly red."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's sore in the mornings. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That all fits with flu on the mend. Rest a few more days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I can't, work needs a note. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll write it for the full week you were off, and three more days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Drink plenty and don't push exercise this week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Understood. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in a week if the cough lingers."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  }
